#########################################################################
# STRATEGY: catalogue-excluded
#
# All of catalogue/ is ignored, including catalogue/docs/merge-into-omero-mvls/
# (this runbook and its companion files). mvls-catalogue's own repo stays
# the sole source of truth for everything under catalogue/ - omero-mvls's
# git history won't contain any record of the merge documentation, only
# the compose.yaml/nginx.conf/certificates.sh/etc. changes it produced.
#
# Simpler ignore rules, at the cost of the runbook itself not being
# preserved in omero-mvls's own git history.
#########################################################################

#########################################################################
# Secrets
#########################################################################
.env

#########################################################################
# Certificates - by file type rather than the whole certs/ folder, so
# anything else placed there isn't silently hidden too.
#   *.key - private keys (omero.key, server.key) - real secrets.
#   *.p12 - PKCS12 bundles (server.p12) - embeds the private key.
#   *.pem - certificates/chains (fullchain.pem, server.pem) and DH
#           params (ffdhe2048.pem) - not secret, but generated by
#           certificates.sh / renewed by IT, not source.
#########################################################################
*.key
*.p12
*.pem

# certs/README.md specifically (not certs/ generally - see above) is a
# stale hand-written note that doesn't match the current setup (it
# references "omeroJM.key" instead of the actual "omero.key", and
# describes separate CertFile/KeyFile properties instead of the actual
# single CertFile server.p12 approach extra.omero uses) - excluded so
# it isn't accidentally committed as-is. Superseded by RUNBOOK.md /
# SETUP.md; delete it or bring it up to date before untracking this
# line.
certs/README.md

#########################################################################
# Database backups (pg_dump output from backup_database.sh)
#########################################################################
backups/

#########################################################################
# External OMERO data (bind-mounted from OMEROFILESEXTERNALPATH) - real
# slide/image data, not part of this repo.
#########################################################################
OMERO/

#########################################################################
# Stray manual backup files from hand-editing configs before a change
# (nginx.conf.old, fullchain.pem.old, omero.oldkey, etc.)
#########################################################################
*.old
*.oldkey
*.bak

#########################################################################
# MVLS Catalogue app - separate project with its own git repo/history.
# Transferred in wholesale as part of the compose merge but not tracked
# here at all - mvls-catalogue's own repo stays the source of truth for
# it, including its merge-into-omero-mvls docs.
#########################################################################
catalogue/
